# Extractor: flat pad built ON a resource node (one per node) — the node produces its resource only
# while its extractor stands. No field, no power use. Spawned origin 0.4 above ground, overlapping
# the node mesh (static vs static never collides).
Prefab gameExtractor
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer wireshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Scale 1.2 0.4 1.2
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1.2 0.4 1.2
